---
title: Container build step
schema:
  Build:
    service: string
    image: string
input: Build
---
# Container build: {{ service }}

Add this step after source checkout in GitHub Actions:

```yaml
- name: Build {{ service }}
  run: docker build --tag "{{ image }}:$\{{ github.sha }}" .
```

GitHub Actions resolves `$\{{ github.sha }}` when the job runs.
